English summary:
You may share and adapt the modern retellings and the Diamond Sutra
commentary for any purpose, even commercially, provided you give
appropriate credit, link to the license, and indicate if changes were
made. Homer's epics and Kumārajīva's Diamond Sutra are in the public
domain; quotations of them in this repository stay in the public domain.
